* '''Wakamiya Shrine''' (deity: {{ill|Ame-no-Kumunushi|ja|天忍雲根命|12=draft|12=draft}})
* '''Akiba Shrine''' (deity: {{ill|Amaterasu|ja|天照大御神|1=Amaterasu|lt=Amaterasu Ōmikami|12=draft|12=draft}}, {{ill|Onamuchi|ja|大巳貴命|12=draft|12=draft}}, {{ill|Haniyasubime|ja|埴安姫神|12=draft|12=draft}}, {{ill|Ukemochi|ja|保食神|12=draft|12=draft}}, {{ill|Sukunabikona|ja|少彦名命|1=Sukunabikona|12=draft|12=draft}})

